Source-specific provenance notes: src/bridge_sha256.h, tools/vendor_fit.py,
and tools/vendor_ubi.py have no file-level copyright or SPDX notices in this
snapshot. The two Python tools use Python standard-library modules to parse FIT
and UBI structures; no third-party parser attribution is present in these
files. If these are newly authored BootBridge code, the grant above applies;
otherwise retain the source implementation's notices and license.

The build also consumes h3c_nand_catalog.h from the separate companion U-Boot
source tree. That header declares SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0+ and is not
included or relicensed by this project COPYING file. Preserve its own notice
and bind the exact header revision and hash when building or redistributing it.
